{"title":"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Digit\" title=\"Digit\">digits</a> in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/b/50b09c1d57aa3df6fb047e4c035e4f9c08409d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{16}5^{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> (when written in the usual <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Base_number\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base number\">base</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> form) is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/3/053a25147eeea0be8cc1246cd3c258bdc3d2f68d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }31 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }30 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 29 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }28 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can rewrite this as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/f/4df65456266e6c93f0254f3963a37fc16d278709.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{32}5^{25}$\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />. We can also combine some of the factors to introduce factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, whose digit count is simple to evaluate because it simply adds <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s. Thus, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/8/7283f54a308fea647c0686eb85f044227b47cd1f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{32}5^{25}=2^72^{25}5^{25}=2^710^{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"204\" height=\"15\" />. We can see that this final number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/c/afc77519ee6bab163b1aa195a3ba88718d414aa4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"17\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s annexed onto it. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/a/bdab99612d6ec89cecfa082adb0afdbf8ceee4ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^7=128$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />, which has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> digits, so the entire number has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/d/c9d2d606351ed255fcdfe9adeb31772fc242e483.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25+3=28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"91\" height=\"14\" /> digits, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bf9089f3c0ad5ee9fca030cfb06b487e559902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{D}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME\" title=\"1984 AHSME\">1984 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title